      "qtr": "2026-06",
      "title": "GOOG & AMZN — inflated trailing EPS",
      "text": "Q2 2026 included one-time investment gains (Alphabet ~$99B, Amazon ~$53B pre-tax, largely Anthropic stakes), so trailing P/E is flattered — for the stocks and for the Magnificent 7 median. Alphabet's Q3 2026 partly reversed this with an $8.7B loss on equity securities (−$0.55/share). Forward P/E is the cleaner read."
    },
