      ],
      "qtr": "2026-03",
      "title": "XOM — depressed trailing EPS",
      "text": "Q1 2026 absorbed ~$0.92/share of negative timing effects and Q2 2026 ~$0.63/share of impairments and reserve additions, so trailing P/E overstates the multiple. Consensus expects 2027 earnings below 2026 as the oil-price spike fades."
    },
