      "title": "UBER — trailing EPS mostly one-offs",
      "text": "Q3 2025 included a ~$2.30/share tax valuation-allowance release, and every quarter swings with revaluations of equity stakes (±$1.5B pre-tax). Forward P/E is the cleaner read. Growth uses Simply Wall St, since Zacks computes off the tax-inflated 2025 base."
